Error [E0320]: Inferred record construction uses `{…}`, not `.{…}`
  --> tests/ui/regex_bad_literal.jet:5:19
    |
  5 |     print(re.find(.{"(unclosed"}, "id=42") ?? "none")
    |                   ^
